SUCCESS 

[i]She approaches you with the bonesaw[/i]

MC: “P-please! I’m too young to die!”

WITCH: “For goodness sake, why would you die? I am trying to reward you.”

join WITCH (happy) center

[i]She takes out a skull and slices its crown off with the bonesaw[/i] 
WITCH: “I think you’re deserving of having your candy early. Now, what seems to be the matter? You came to a doctor for a real reason, correct?”

MC: “No… I just wanted to trick or treat..”

[i]She hums with amusement[/i]

WITCH: “I find you peculiar. Please, take this”

join WITCH (default)

[i]From the cauldron comes a writhing mass of ooze, which solidifies and transforms into a black cat[/i]
WITCH: “My familiar. I’d like to watch your actions within this neighborhood. May she serve you well”


